This repository contains original MLA shared-latent calibration code and local
reference adaptations of existing quantization and evaluation methods.

OSCAR
  https://github.com/FutureMLS-Lab/OSCAR
  MLA reference source commit: 19f85e13059de3da60686af4cbdd778b5671d9ff
  Copyright (c) 2026 FutureMLS-Lab and the OSCAR authors.
  License: MIT; retained in licenses/OSCAR-MIT.txt.
  mla_quant/oscar.py preserves the MLA rotation and affine-grid INT2 arithmetic.

KVarN
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.03458
  Local PyTorch adaptation in mla_quant/cache.py; content-latent cache semantics
  differ from separate expanded K/V tensors.
  Upstream license: Apache-2.0; retained in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

RULER
  https://github.com/NVIDIA/RULER
  Copyright (c) 2024, NVIDIA CORPORATION. All rights reserved.
  License: Apache-2.0.
  The source copyright/license header is retained in mla_quant/ruler_metrics.py.
  The data generator is fetched as an external dependency, not vendored.

lm-evaluation-harness
  https://github.com/EleutherAI/lm-evaluation-harness
  License: MIT; retained in licenses/lm-eval-MIT.txt.
  The HumanEval instruction adapter follows the upstream evaluation protocol.
